    20	| `SEALED` | `V025_PROBE_R2/world/2:step/1` | 53 | yes | 881058034.074074626 | 881058034.074074388 | -2.384185791015625e-07 |
    21	
    22	Both violations are sub-microbit binary64 differences in SEALED users that are C1-served but below target. Despite them, the directly measured pooled capped numerator rises by 303.093740 Gbit for SEALED and 16.039692 Gbit for STRICT.
